        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akshaye Khanna, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Ravi Udyawar\n- Films: Mom, Border, Taal, Dil Chahta Hai, Humraaz, Hulchul, Gandhi, My Father, Race\n- Roles: film actor, director, supporting actor\n- Awards: Filmfare Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Akshaye Khanna was born on 28 March 1975 and is an Indian film actor.\n- Akshaye Khanna appeared in the films Border (1997), Taal (1999), Dil Chahta Hai (2001), Humraaz (2002), Hulchul (2004), Gandhi, My Father (2007), and Race (2008).\n- Akshaye Khanna received two Filmfare Awards for his film work.\n- Mom is a 2017 Indian thriller film directed by Ravi Udyawar.\n- Akshaye Khanna and Nawazuddin Siddiqui played supporting roles in Mom.",
